-q\">What does a farmhouse interior designer plan for maintenance?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Durable floors, washable fabrics, enough storage and easy access to services keep a large farmhouse simple to look after.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>An Estate That Feels Like Home</h2>\n            <p>Size alone does not make a great farmhouse. A thoughtful farmhouse interior designer makes it comfortable, practical and full of character.</p><p>Have an estate near Rajokri or Westend Greens? <a href=\"/rajokri/contact\">Invite 9th Corner for a walk-through</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}